{"authorDailyContributionsMap":{"eugenia-cnl-lee":[{"date":"2026-02-05T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"23e47d3ecd4ebf018fc1e13920bc306ad66acdbe","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Rename chatbot and add basic greeting and exit","messageBody":"The chatbot\u0027s name is Duke and so is the main source file name.\nThe main source file prints out a \u0027Duke\u0027 logo.\n\nIt needs to change because,\n* the chatbot\u0027s name needs to differentiate from other chatbots\u0027 names\n* just printing the logo does not help achieve the goal of the chatbot\n  being a personal assistant which helps the user keep track of various\n  things\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* rename the chatbot to Athena\n* rename Duke.java to Athena.java\n* delete the chatbot logo\n* implement an initial skeletal version (with horizontal lines seperating\n  the starting and ending greetings) of the chatbot to greet the user\n  and exit\n\nIt is done this way because,\n* Athena is not a common name choice, hence differentiating it a lot\n* for consistency\u0027s sake and to prevent potential future bugs\n* horizontal lines will make formatting for future code and main body\n  content prompts easier and nicer, laying a good foundation for a\n  skeleton code\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":12,"deletions":10}}},{"hash":"24939298b18f3a7da6622735a625a8afc66dc4ca","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Turn into OOP style","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":14,"deletions":8}}},{"hash":"b6bc4ea267e695e99108e7c157e8e83f3d12b3b8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Added personality to the bot","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":8,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"b394159ae15ec191b7a35b1e7ca2ec76f3810b2b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Standardise code style to match Java conventions","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-0"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":7,"deletions":7}}},{"hash":"bd88dc54d9d31c5fe4f84b0aa